{
    "openapi": "3.0.3",
    "info": {
      "title": "RiftFi Vault API",
      "description": "API endpoints for interacting with the RiftFi Yield Vault on Base network. Users can deposit USDC, earn yield rewards, request withdrawals, and claim rewards. All user write operations are executed gaslessly via smart wallet abstraction.\n\n## Authentication\n\n### API Key (Required for all endpoints)\nAll endpoints require an API key passed in the `X-API-Key` header.\n\n### JWT Token (Required for user endpoints)\nUser-specific endpoints (`/vault/user/*`) require a valid JWT token in the `Authorization: Bearer <token>` header. The JWT contains the user's encrypted private key which is used to sign transactions.\n\n## Flow Overview\n\n### Deposit Flow\n1. User calls `POST /vault/user/deposit` with amount\n2. Backend derives user's smart wallet address from their encrypted private key\n3. Backend checks USDC allowance for the smart wallet\n4. If insufficient, backend submits gasless approval via smart wallet API\n5. Backend waits for allowance to update on-chain\n6. Backend calls the Yield Aggregator deposit endpoint\n7. User receives confirmation with transaction hashes\n\n### Withdrawal Flow\n1. User calls `POST /vault/user/withdraw` with amount\n2. Withdrawal request is queued in the smart contract\n3. Admin processes pending withdrawals in batches (daily)\n4. User can cancel pending withdrawal before processing\n\n### Claim Flow\n1. User calls `POST /vault/user/claim` to request reward claim\n2. Claim request is queued in the smart contract\n3. Admin processes pending claims in batches (daily)\n4. User can cancel pending claim before processing",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "contact": {
        "name": "RiftFi",
        "url": "https://riftfi.xyz"
      }
    },
    "servers": [
      {
        "url": "https://payment.riftfi.xyz",
        "description": "Production server"
      },
      {
        "url": "http://localhost:8000",
        "description": "Local development server"
      }
    ],
    "tags": [
      {
        "name": "Protocol",
        "description": "Protocol-wide statistics and information (API key required)"
      },
      {
        "name": "Contract",
        "description": "Smart contract information (API key required)"
      },
      {
        "name": "User",
        "description": "User-specific data and operations (API key + JWT required)"
      }
    ],
    "paths": {
      "/vault/protocol/stats": {
        "get": {
          "tags": ["Protocol"],
          "summary": "Get all protocol statistics",
          "description": "Returns comprehensive protocol statistics including TVL, total deposits, pending rewards, rewards distributed, and queue counts.",
          "security": [{ "ApiKeyAuth": [] }],
          "responses": {
            "200": {
              "description": "Protocol statistics retrieved successfully",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProtocolStats" },
                  "example": {
                    "tvl": "1000000.00",
                    "totalDeposits": "950000.00",
                    "pendingRewards": "50000.00",
                    "rewardsDistributed": "25000.00",
                    "pendingClaimersCount": 5,
                    "pendingWithdrawersCount": 3,
                    "version": "1.1.0",
                    "stablecoin": "0x833589fCD6eDb6E08f4c7C32D4f71b54bdA02913",
                    "admin": "0xA8E138f613ed04Eb7229F43e8B0f05a91480A0fA"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "500": {
              "description": "Server error",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error" }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
